  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If the owner of a VRChat group assigns themselves to a custom role that requires Two-Factor Authentication while their account does not have 2FA enabled, the website locks them out of all group management actions.\n\nBecause the user is the owner:\n\n- They cannot delete the group (requires 2FA).\n\n- They cannot change their role (UI blocks all actions until 2FA is enabled).\n\n- They cannot disable the 2FA requirement on the role.\n\n- They cannot leave the group because owners cannot leave.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n- Create a group.\n\n- Create a custom role that requires 2FA.\n\n- Assign this role to yourself (the owner).\n\n- Do not have 2FA enabled on your account.\n\n- Try to edit settings, change roles, or delete the group.",
